  "details": "A minor accessibility / usability annoyance with screen reader software at https://wiki.vrchat.com/ during a maintenance.\n\nThere's a hyperlink simply titled \"Status page\" on the maintenance notice as seen at https://wiki.vrchat.com/. When a screen reader software lists links on a page, it reads an ambiguous \"Status page\" instead of saying the link is to view the VRChat status page.\n\nSteps to reproduce: Visit https://wiki.vrchat.com/ during a maintenance.\n\nExpected markup (line 22): `<p class=\"p g\"><a href=\"https://status.vrchat.com/\">View the VRChat status page</a></p>`\n\nActual original markup: `<p class=\"p g\"><a href=\"https://status.vrchat.com/\">Status page</a></p>`",
